#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid ""
"Do you play Singles or Doubles Tournaments? This plugin manages Rotation "
"Tournaments where players have a different partner in each game."
msgstr ""
"¿Juegas torneos individuales o de dobles? Este plugin gestiona torneos "
"rotativos en los que los jugadores tienen un compañero distinto en cada "
"juego."

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Rotation Tournaments"
msgstr "Torneos rotativos"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid ""
"After installation, go to the app's settings and enter the address of your "
"website where this plugin is installed."
msgstr ""
"Tras la instalación, ve a los ajustes de la aplicación e ingresa la "
"dirección del sitio web donde está instalado este plugin."

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid ""
"Or download it directly from this link: "
"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"
msgstr ""
"O descárgala directamente desde este enlace: "
"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=cz.doroto.app"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
msgid "Search for \"Rotation Tournaments\" on the Google Play Store."
msgstr "Busca “Rotation Tournaments” en Google Play Store."

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid ""
"To get the full experience of managing tournaments on the go, download our "
"mobile app, now available on Google Play!"
msgstr ""
"Para gestionar los torneos sobre la marcha con todas las funciones, descarga"
" nuestra aplicación móvil, ¡ya disponible en Google Play!"

